            <ArticleTitle>Interrelation of coronary and cerebral arteriosclerosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>233-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In our investigation the histories of 323 patients diagnosed as MI and CVA were examined. After a detailed examination of our set it has been proved that there is a relation between the CNS and heart arterial systems, by which the existence of this syndrome (SACC) has been proved.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
